<title>SPAIN: Spain's Aug trade deficit narrows to 179.9 bln pts.</title>
<headline>Spain's Aug trade deficit narrows to 179.9 bln pts.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The customs department of the economy ministry gave the following figures (billions of pesetas):</p>
<p> TRADE BALANCE	     AUG 96	 JUL 96	AUG 95</p>
<p> Exports		     754.2	 1,085.6	 689.9</p>
<p> Imports		     934.2	 1,307.8	 978.8</p>
<p> Deficit/surplus	   179.9	  -222.2	-289.0</p>
<p> Deficit yr to date     1,736.1     -1,556.1    -1,947.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are customs-cleared data.  </p>
<p> TRADE BALANCE (EU)	AUG 96	 JUL 96	 AUG 95</p>
<p> Exports			501.1	 737.1	  468.5</p>
<p> Imports			566.3	 852.6	  620.1</p>
<p> Deficit/surplus	   -65.2	  -115.5	 -151.6</p>
<p> Def/surplus yr to date  -579.8	 -514.6	 -716.3</p>
</text>
